{"id":"e79ea45002ccf795","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-condplainkolm.md","title":"Conditional Plain Complexity","display":"df-condplainkolm — Conditional Plain Complexity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-condplainkolm","aliases":["43-df-condplainkolm"],"display":"df-condplainkolm — Conditional Plain Complexity","depends_on":["[[43-df-string]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-pair-coding]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"§6.2, conditional complexity","source_printed_pages":"90–91","source_pdf_pages":"110–111","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-condplainkolm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-condplainkolm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-condplainkolm — Conditional Plain Complexity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§6.2, conditional complexity"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"90–91"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"110–111"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,V:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\">\\(M,V:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 表示部分函数值同时无定义或同时有定义且相等。固定满足下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalConditionalPlain}(V)\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalConditionalPlain}(V)\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_M(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\">\\(C_M(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\\)</span> 的值域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\\varnothing=+\\infty\">\\(\\min\\varnothing=+\\infty\\)</span>；自然数辅助输入使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalConditionalPlain}(V)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Computable}(V)\\land\\forall M:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}(M)\\to\\exists\\rho\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall p,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\;V(\\rho p,\\tau)\\simeq M(p,\\tau)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{UniversalConditionalPlain}(V)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Computable}(V)\\land\\forall M:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}(M)\\to\\exists\\rho\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall p,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\;V(\\rho p,\\tau)\\simeq M(p,\\tau)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_M(\\sigma\\mid\\tau)\\coloneqq\\min\\{|p|:p\\in\\Sigma^*\\land((p,\\tau),\\sigma)\\in\\operatorname{graph}M\\},\\qquad C(\\sigma\\mid\\tau)\\coloneqq C_V(\\sigma\\mid\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_M(\\sigma\\mid\\tau)\\coloneqq\\min\\{|p|:p\\in\\Sigma^*\\land((p,\\tau),\\sigma)\\in\\operatorname{graph}M\\},\\qquad C(\\sigma\\mid\\tau)\\coloneqq C_V(\\sigma\\mid\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C(\\sigma\\mid n)\\coloneqq C(\\sigma\\mid\\operatorname{bin}(n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C(\\sigma\\mid n)\\coloneqq C(\\sigma\\mid\\operatorname{bin}(n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是普通条件复杂度，不把 oracle 相对复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^A\">\\(C^A\\)</span> 与有限辅助字符串复杂度混用；两个参数均为有限串。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§6.2, conditional complexity；印刷页 90–91，PDF 页 110–111。来源定位沿用附件；此次修订核查形式化与内部一致性，未重新核对原书 PDF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Asserti